  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "BODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/c0j5U9v2oJWEzSTKvdDLWZ5Zik3PBUXk-C9w3Ma990WH63rpQUfA7g-3wh_uT7CgFvFJ4jPGEeOw509FxSgfh78_HR9tDNZ9KitXdEveKsLaLMgPQf6YSDt1b775728JMVp9FIQs=s0] \n\nThe given equation is:\n\n(√225 ÷ 8) + (112 × 7) + 23 − 12 = 130\n\nFirst, simplify √225:\n\n√225 = 15\n\nSo the equation becomes:\n\n(15 ÷ 8) + (112 × 7) + 23 − 12 = 130\n\n**1) Interchange 8 and 7, × and −**\n\nNew Equation: (15 ÷ 7) + (112 − 8) + 23 × 12 = ?\n\n⇒ (__**15 ÷ 7**__) + (__**112 − 8**__) + 23 × 12\n\n⇒ 2.14+ 104 + __**23 × 12**__ \n\n⇒ __**2.14 + 104**__ + 276 \n\n⇒ __**106.14+ 276**__ \n\n⇒ 382.14 ≠ 130 (Incorrect)\n\n**2) Interchange 7 and 23, ÷ and ×**\n\nNew Equation: (15 × 8) + (112 ÷ 23) + 7 − 12 = ?\n\n⇒ (__**15 × 8**__) + (__**112 ÷ 23**__) + 7 − 12\n\n⇒ __**120 + 4.86**__ + 7 − 12 \n\n⇒ __**124.86+ 7**__ − 12 \n\n⇒ __**131.86 − 12**__ \n\n⇒ 119.86 ≠ 130 (Incorrect)\n\n**3) Interchange 112 and 23, ÷ and −**\n\nNew Equation: (15 − 8) + (23 × 7) + 112 ÷ 12 = ?\n\n⇒ (__**15 − 8**__) + (__**23 × 7**__) + 112 ÷ 12\n\n⇒ 7 + 161 + __**112 ÷ 12**__ \n\n⇒ __**7 + 161**__ + 9.33\n\n⇒ __**168 + 9.33**__\n\n⇒ 177.33. ≠ 130 (Incorrect)\n\n**4) Interchange 8 and 7, ÷ and ×**\n\nNew Equation: (15 × 7) + (112 ÷ 8) + 23 − 12 = ?\n\nPerform operations according to BODMAS:\n\n⇒ (__**15 × 7**__) + (__**112 ÷ 8**__) + 23 − 12 \n\n⇒ __**105 + 14**__ + 23 − 12 \n\n⇒ __**119 + 23**__ − 12\n\n⇒ __**142 − 12**__ \n\n⇒ 130\n\n130 = 130 (Correct)\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
